No third-party code is bundled; everything runs on the CPython standard
library. The environment's service corpus paraphrases and cites public
service and product guidance by source ID only; no source text, page image,
PDF or URL is reproduced (env/THIRD-PARTY.md). Service-source material keeps
the terms of its publishers.

The engine is a real 1990s 1.6 L SOHC inline-four. The geometry, part
identities and service positions are the benchmark's own labelled model of it;
no manufacturer or model names are used.

Model and client names appear only as labels for the runs and as examples of
MCP client configuration; they belong to their owners. The model labels of the
exploratory runs are the models the harness requested; served model identity
was not attested.

